{"id": "3010481", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3010481", "title": "US Open 2023 \u2013 Dublu mixt", "text": "US Open 2023 \u2013 Dublu mixt a avut loc la sf\u00e2r\u0219itul lunii august \u0219i \u00eenceputul lunii septembrie 2023. Treizeci \u0219i dou\u0103 de perechi au intrat \u00een competi\u021bia mixt\u0103 a Grand Slamului de tenis de la New York, care s-a joac\u0103 pe suprafa\u021ba dur\u0103 de la Billie Jean King National Tennis Center. Campionii \u00een exerci\u021biu au fost Storm Sanders \u0219i John Peers din Australia, dar au pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103 \u00een fa\u021ba perechii Barbora Str\u00fdcov\u00e1 \u0219i Santiago Gonz\u00e1lez. Str\u00fdcov\u00e1, fost\u0103 nr. 1 mondial la dublu, a jucat ultimul ei meci la profesioni\u0219ti \u00een sferturile de final\u0103.\nAnna Danilina \u0219i Harri Heli\u00f6vaara au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu mixt, \u00eenving\u00e2nd \u00een final\u0103 perechea Jessica Pegula \u0219i Austin Krajicek, cu 6\u20133, 6\u20134. Danilina a devenit prima juc\u0103toare kazah\u0103 campioan\u0103 de Grand Slam la dublu mixt, \u00een timp ce Heli\u00f6vaara a devenit primul finlandez campion de dublu mixt la US Open.\nTabloul principal.\nFinal\u0103.\n&lt;section begin=\"mixt\" /&gt;\n&lt;section end=\"mixt\" /&gt;"}
